{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--md-review","name":"md-review","description":"Converts a markdown PR writeup or code review (one with ```diff fenced blocks and severity-tagged > [!BLOCKER]/[!MAJOR]/[!MINOR]/[!NIT] callouts) into a single-file 2-column HTML review — unified-diff on the left, severity-tagged annotation cards on the right, top jump-nav listing every finding, mandatory named reviewer footer. Triggers when the markdown-html-orchestrator classifies an input as REVIEW, or when invoked directly via /cs:md-review. Refuses without explicit --reviewer (a code review must name a human), refuses if no diff hunks present (route to md-document instead), and refuses to encode severity in color only (every badge ships color + icon + aria-label per WCAG 1.4.1). Use after orchestrator routing.","category":"Development","tags":["md","review","converts","markdown","pr","writeup","code","one","diff","fenced","blocks","severity","tagged","blocker","major","minor","nit","callouts"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"markdown-html/skills/md-review","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/markdown-html/skills/md-review","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":9,"bytes":68075,"sha256":"35bc4f00511cdb9996745841014ff8792cb3e38a3682b0890a461920b7839a62","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"markdown-html/skills/md-review/SKILL.md","bytes":6532,"sha256":"35bc4f00511cdb9996745841014ff8792cb3e38a3682b0890a461920b7839a62","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/markdown-html/skills/md-review/SKILL.md"},{"path":"assets/md_review_template.html","sourcePath":"markd